  "Shopping destinations open only Shopping List.": "Shopping destinations open only Shopping List. Explain the appropriate control and exact tab: Grocery Store Coach > Find a Product, Product Scan, or Grocery Store Coach > Build a Meal. Build a Meal is the visible tab label; do not call it Create a Meal. Never claim a dialog/tab was opened, a product/request transferred, or shopping completed. Personalized product recommendations, label evaluation, meals and lists are performed by those existing features, not this chat.",
